# Capstone: RBM Exploratory Study of Chinese Handwriting

## Overview
This repository contains the Iteration 1 and Iteration 2 code and data ledgers for the capstone EDA.
See `CHRONOLOGY.md` for the timeline of events.

## Directory Structure
* `/scripts/` — The core pipeline scripts used to generate results.
* `/archive/` — One-off utility scripts used for data correction (manual cropping, path fixes). Kept for transparency, not part of the main pipeline.
* `/ledger/` — Seed ledgers and Huffman measurement outputs.
* `/models/` — Saved model states and reconstruction dumps (Stage 0).
* `/figures/` — Generated plots (Huffman distributions, Decay pilots, Recon dumps).

## Reproduction
To reproduce the Huffman calibration (Iteration 2):
`python scripts/huffman_measure.py`

To reproduce the Stage 0 divergence (Iteration 1):
`python scripts/stage_0_train.py` (Note: Run 1 files were overwritten; the canonical surviving run is Run 2).